{"about":["Bring In Your Bounty, Dead or Alive","Let the Hunt Begin","In this classic third-person action-adventure, you'll become Jango Fett, Prime Clone of the Grand Army of the Republic, hired to capture a deranged Dark Jedi.","Relive the Timeless Tale","Experience the legendary Bounty Hunter fantasy set before the events of Star Wars: Episode II - Attack of the Clones. Face off against foes and maneuver through acrobatic battles in this adaption optimized for today's consoles and hardware.","Armed to the Teeth","Fight your way through the galaxy’s underbelly, equipped with Dual Blasters, your Flamethrower, Whipcord, and pure Mandalorian Rage.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/1916/d5fc410cbb74af8b287d77df88ca6aeffd31dd19209f5073.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/1916/d5fc410cbb74af8b287d77df88ca6aeffd31dd19209f5073.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/1916/cac69f5bfd58ef8251e35e60c59627e1cdf1f3956c248a3a.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/1916/cac69f5bfd58ef8251e35e60c59627e1cdf1f3956c248a3a.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/1916/5b5db4b5523058da208cabdf297d399efe4d7a9ce9a816ed.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/1916/5b5db4b5523058da208cabdf297d399efe4d7a9ce9a816ed.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/1916/a39d8bcde6d4acad14c28ca9a461c8469eaed92390eb86dc.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/